&lt;li&gt;Partner with the AI &amp;amp; Organic Search Manager to turn discoverability opportunities into high-impact content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build hands-on experience with Tailscale to create credible, practical technical content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce content at a high velocity while maintaining a high bar for technical accuracy and editorial quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing, Product, Engineering, Developer Relations, Docs, and subject matter experts to ensure content is accurate and useful.&lt;/li&gt;
