&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–6+ years of experience in growth technical content marketing, technical writing, developer marketing, journalism, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional writing and editing skills with the ability to explain complex technical concepts clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SEO and AI discoverability best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly curious with a hunger to learn and jump head-first into tough challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating educational content for technical or enterprise audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable learning new technologies and building with products to create authentic technical content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to research, draft, and improve content quality and production speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills and the ability to work closely with engineering, product, and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
